## FINAL PRODUCT VISION

The finished Uttarkunth Products pillar should work as follows:

A visitor opens `/products` and sees a complete, professionally designed Himalayan marketplace. While no products are available, the site displays an elegant Coming Soon experience.

A genuine seller registers through Uttarkunth, receives approval and gains access to Seller Desk from their profile.

The seller can create products, associate brands, upload photographs, define origin, manage stock, set prices and discounts, and enter their own delivery arrangements.

Submitted products go through Uttarkunth's review process.

The Founder remains the only platform administrator. The Founder may delegate particular responsibilities to Product Team employees, who can only perform their specifically assigned duties.

Once an approved product is published, it automatically appears in the public marketplace.

A user who is both a host and a seller can access Host Dashboard and Seller Desk next to each other from their profile, with their respective business functions remaining independent.

**Build this as a real, secure, scalable marketplace extension of Uttarkunth — not as a static design mockup.**